      "content": "serotonin syndrome sounds scary... i thought the tyramine thing was more about blood pressure? my doctor didn't really go into detail about what i actually can't eat, just that i had to be careful. i'm really worried about losing muscle mass though, so if i just stick to small amounts of these things, is it really gonna be an issue? like if i just have a bit of cheese on a cracker or some soy sauce in a stir fry it's fine right?",
